---
import ButterflyArt from './ButterflyArt.astro';
import PlantArt from './PlantArt.astro';
import PollinatorIcon from './PollinatorIcon.astro';
import { url } from '../utils/url';
---

<section class="refuge" id="refugio">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="refuge__intro" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">Empezá acá</p>
      <h2>Quiero que mi hogar sea un refugio de polinizadores</h2>
      <p class="lead">Un refugio completo tiene dos tipos de plantas: las que dan de comer a todos y las que crían a cada mariposa. Elegí por dónde arrancar.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="refuge__cards">
      <a class="refuge-card refuge-card--nectar" href={url('/nectariferas/')} data-reveal data-parallax-scene>
        <div class="refuge-card__art">
          <div class="refuge-card__layer" data-parallax="0.1"><PlantArt id="salvia-azul" /></div>
        </div>
        <div class="refuge-card__body">
          <span class="chip chip--orange">Generales</span>
          <h3>Plantas nectaríferas para polinizadores</h3>
          <p>El bar abierto del barrio. Sus flores alimentan a colibríes, abejas, abejorros y mariposas adultas.</p>
          <ul class="refuge-card__icons" aria-label="Alimentan a colibríes, mariposas, abejas y abejorros">
            <li><PollinatorIcon id="hummingbirds" /></li>
            <li><PollinatorIcon id="butterflies" /></li>
            <li><PollinatorIcon id="bees" /></li>
            <li><PollinatorIcon id="bumblebees" /></li>
          </ul>
          <span class="refuge-card__cta">Ver las 10 nectaríferas <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="refuge-card refuge-card--host" href={url('/mariposas/')} data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.1" data-parallax-scene>
        <div class="refuge-card__art">
          <div class="refuge-card__layer" data-parallax="0.1"><PlantArt id="mburucuya" /></div>
          <ButterflyArt id="espejito" uid="card" class="refuge-card__butterfly" />
        </div>
        <div class="refuge-card__body">
          <span class="chip">Específicas</span>
          <h3>Plantas nutricias para mariposas</h3>
          <p>La guardería. Cada mariposa nativa cría a sus orugas en plantas puntuales: conocé diez mariposas de la ciudad y la planta que necesitan.</p>
          <span class="refuge-card__cta">Ver las 10 mariposas y sus plantas <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .refuge {
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 11vw, 10rem);
    background: var(--butter);
  }

  .refuge__intro {
    max-width: 56rem;
    margin: 0 auto clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .refuge__intro h2 {
    margin-block: 0.3em 0.5em;
    color: var(--green-900);
  }

  .refuge__intro .lead {
    max-width: 50ch;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .refuge__cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 22rem), 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
  }

  .refuge-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: calc(var(--radius) * 1.4);
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1), box-shadow 0.4s;
  }

  .refuge-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-0.5rem);
    box-shadow: 0 2.2rem 3.5rem -1.5rem rgb(43 33 24 / 0.45);
  }

  .refuge-card--nectar {
    background: var(--orange-500);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .refuge-card--host {
    background: var(--green-700);
    color: var(--butter-light);
  }

  .refuge-card__art {
    position: relative;
    height: clamp(15rem, 34vw, 24rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 78%, rgb(255 243 196 / 0.55) 0 38%, transparent 39%);
  }

  .refuge-card__layer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: center;
    height: 100%;
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .refuge-card__layer :global(.plant-art) {
    height: 100%;
    width: auto;
  }

  .refuge-card__art :global(.refuge-card__butterfly) {
    position: absolute;
    top: 12%;
    right: 10%;
    width: 34%;
    rotate: 18deg;
    transition: rotate 0.6s, translate 0.6s;
  }

  .refuge-card:hover :global(.refuge-card__butterfly) {
    rotate: 6deg;
    translate: -0.5rem -0.5rem;
  }

  .refuge-card__body {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    justify-items: start;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    background: rgb(255 250 230 / 0.12);
  }

  .refuge-card__icons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .refuge-card__icons li {
    width: 2.6rem;
    padding: 0.35rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--butter-light);
  }

  .refuge-card__cta {
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    font: 700 1rem var(--font-sans);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
  }
</style>
